Article 2 (Participation by the International Fund)
(1) Participation under Article 36 of the Act shall be made in writing to the court before which limitation proceedings are pending.
(2) An application for participation under paragraph (1) shall state the following matters:
1. The case number of the limitation proceedings;
2. The name and address of the representative and, if there is no place for service within the Republic of Korea, the name and address of the person authorized to receive service;
3. The purpose of and reasons for the participation.
